// coefficient table for the opt-in `path.spectral.upsampling = jh2019`
// mode.
//
// The model: SPD(lambda) = sigmoid(c0*lambda^2 + c1*lambda + c2) with
// sigmoid(x) = 0.5 + 0.5*x/sqrt(1+x^2) and lambda in nm. The 3
// coefficients per RGB triplet come from this table via the
